 "remarks": "SONO 2 bedroom 2 full bath Duplex Townhouse 1 block over from Washington Street in vibrant downtown SONO!, come enjoy the neighborhood...this Charming Victorian apartment, has been totally renovated. Living room with fireplace (decoration purposes only) and wood floors. Sparkling and sunny kitchen with stainless steel appliances. Washer/Dryer in unit. Bathroom with walk in shower, custom glass doors. Spacious bedroom with closet. Large Lower level with multi use room....use it as a office/gym/bedroom, large closets and storage, New full bath and luxury vinyl flooring. Entire apartment has been freshly painted, 2 reserved off street parking spots. Walk to shopping, movies, new Mall and restaurants... close to all SONO has to offer. 2 block to train for commuters. A MUST SEE!",
